Package: maumauR
Title: Simulation and Analysis of the DB Mau Mau Card Game
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Provides a configurable engine, Monte Carlo simulator, and
    strategy framework for the "der kleine ICE" Mau Mau card game, a
    German children's variant of Mau Mau with draw-two, skip, and wild
    cards. Includes win-rate estimation by seat and player count, pluggable
    artificial strategies for comparison, game-length and draw-count
    distribution summaries, and an interactive Shiny application for playing
    against the simulated opponents.
